# RBAC & Multitenancy

- Implement role checks at resolver/service level (Owner/Admin/Doctor/Reception/Solo).
- Pass `tenantId` in context/session; **all** queries/mutations must be scoped by tenant.
- For lists: default to **current tenant**, forbid cross-tenant access.
- Add audit records for sensitive operations (file view, status change).
